  "description": "Reserved Matters Application in relation to Plots 1, 2A, 2B and 3 of the Grahame Park North East development pursuant to Condition 4 attached to outline planning permission 25/3588/OUT (dated 21 August 2026). This application seeks approval of details relating to access, layout, scale, appearance and landscaping for the residential mixed-use development comprising 449 residential units (Use Class C3) and 250 sqm GIA of commercial floorspace (Use Class E (a)/(b) across four buildings within three development parcels, ranging from 4 to 21 storeys in height, together with public open space and public realm, children's play space, communal amenity space, car and cycle parking, refuse storage, sustainable drainage infrastructure, new and altered access arrangements, re-levelling and other associated works.\r \rThe application is accompanied by details submitted pursuant to Conditions 7 (Housing Accommodation Schedule), 8 (Internal Space Standards), 25 (Air Quality Neutral and Air Quality Positive Mitigation Measures), 33 (Flood Risk Measures), 36 (Play Space Strategy), 56 (Wind Microclimate Assessment and Mitigation), 58 (Daylight/Sunlight Compliance and Mitigation Strategy), 61 (Fire Safety Provisions) and 62 (Updated Energy and Overheating Strategy)",
